# 0.2 (`GENRE-CONNECTOR-SPELLING`): under `flowchart` the connector is `flowline`.
figdown 0.2 flowchart
title "Ingress"
terminator rx "Frame received"
decision acl "ACL match?"
process fwd "Forward"
flowline rx -> acl
flowline acl -[deny]-> fwd   # a trailing comment survives the rewrite
flowline acl [a] -- [b] fwd style=dotted
